<speak>Yes, I understand. The holding can fall with the market, and if buyers don't meet my minimum price, I'll still be holding it and exposed to further falls. Give me a brief moment to finish writing on this line. I'm not looking at another screen or taking another call. I just prefer to finish a sentence in the notebook before moving to the next subject. There, that's done. It's a habit from the old days when every meeting had handwritten minutes. Even now, I find I remember a conversation better if I have written the important parts myself.</speak>